      <mxCell id="BusinessRulesNote" parent="1" vertex="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=15;spacingRight=15;spacingTop=8;strokeColor=#c59b37;fillColor=#fff6dc;fontSize=16;" value="&lt;b&gt;Business constraints (see report)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;1. Each customer and vehicle can take part in multiple rentals over time, but neither can be involved in more than one active hire at a time. Cancelled rental records are retained but do not count as active.&lt;br/&gt;2. A completed rental has at least two signed damage reports: at least one PRE_HIRE and one POST_HIRE. More reports may be stored; reports are added as the hire progresses.&lt;br/&gt;3. withTrailer is true only for an ArticulatedLorry rental, and records a choice made for that hire."><mxGeometry x="70" y="1069" width="1545" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root>
